SUMMARY:Birdstone + BIRDSTONE + LIQUID EARTH (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Rhiz
DESCRIPTION:BIRDSTONE IV EUROPEAN TOUR Datum: 10.11.2026 | Einlass: 18:30 Uhr Beginn: 19:00 | Ende: 21:45 Uhr  NO Presale only AK 10 € BIRDSTONE: Birdstone is driven by an irresistible desire to combine the spiritual power of the blues with the richness of progressive rock. At the crossroads of mythological themes\, esotericism and simple human passions\, the trio tells of human's inner struggles and their mystical aspirations. Each concert becomes a wild ritual in which the audience and the golden-faced musicians fight together for the salvation of their souls. They will present their fourth and new album\, "IV". LIQUID EARTH: In 2015 Liquid Earth was born in a shipping-container on the outskirts of Vienna. The instrumental trio takes you on a journey through psychedelic soundscapes and heavy riffs. So grab a beer and prepare for takeoff! After the heavy-psych band released their self-produced debut-album "Slow Grown" in 2018\, their single "Teufelsmusik" was released on December the 4th 2020 via "Electric Fire Records". On October the 21st 2022 their second album "Teufelskreis" was released.
URL:https://rhiz.wien/copilotevent/10-11-2026_birdstone-birdstone-liquid-earth-support-liquid-earth
